OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of jobs under threat at
OL,4,AGrangemouth chemical plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of jobs are under threat in
OL,7,FGrangemouth after an agricultural
OL,8,Fchemical firm announced plans to cease
OL,9,Foperations at the site.
OL,11,FSyngenta said it had been unable to
OL,12,Fmake its business at the plant
OL,13,F"competitive" in the face of
OL,14,F"increasing international competition".
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the company - which
OL,17,Fmanufactures chemicals used for the
OL,18,Fprotection of crops - said it would
OL,19,Fenter a consultation period over the
OL,20,Fmove, but added a final decision has
OL,21,Fyet to be taken.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
